OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers near eastern
OL,6,Fcoasts in the morning but otherwise it
OL,7,Fwill be a dry day with bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells, the best of these in the
OL,9,Fmorning. Winds strengthening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and cloudy start to the
OL,12,Fevening but heavy rain, wintry over
OL,13,Fhigh ground, soon spreading eastwards
OL,14,Fand continuing overnight. Strong winds
OL,15,Fand coastal gales possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
