OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fin the morning, gradually clearing
OL,7,Feastwards through the afternoon.
OL,8,FTurning brighter and drier in the
OL,9,Fwest. Breezy at first, then winds
OL,10,Fbecome light.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy,
OL,13,Fwith some light rain or drizzle
OL,14,Fpossible on Saturday. Breezy with
OL,15,Fbright spells and showers on Sunday.
OL,16,FRain and strong winds arriving from
OL,17,Fthe west on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
